Missing edges / caveats:
  Plugin construction is called at top level and again by each export.
  Provenance hashes only src/compiler/THC/*.hs (nonrecursive); imported deeper
    compiler modules are not covered by that list. It also omits plugin.py,
    thc.cabal, polyglot-abi.json and simd-families.json, although invoked tools
    consume them.
  verify() writes both audit files and checks.json. --check-only first validates
    old hashes, then calls this writer; it is not a read-only input check.
  This producer has no dependency on another fixture's generated oracle/Core.
    Its missing graph edges are the shared tools and its own consumers.

