Shared SIMD byte-array producer, 030-033
  t/haskell-fixtures/SimdByteArrayFixtures.hs:prepareSimdByteArray; model and case
  declarations in SimdByteArrayModel.hs; Main.hs, FixtureSupport.hs, built thc-fixtures
  with in-process CBD encoder/decoder. Shared exporter/plugin and Python auditor
